WEBVTT

00:05:32.578 --> 00:05:34.955
(Music ends)

00:05:37.249 --> 00:05:42.797
(Applause)

00:05:48.344 --> 00:05:50.763
In 1992,

00:05:50.805 --> 00:05:54.266
I was writing a song about my divorce,

00:05:54.266 --> 00:05:56.018
which hadn't happened yet.

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:57.937
(Laughter)

00:05:57.937 --> 00:06:02.024
But which I saw coming
like a freight train.